{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Lazy Angel Mika",
    "steam_appid": 3340330,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Hospitality&quot;... That is one of the most important study subject for angels, who will be guiding humans and providing them assistance in the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How-e-ver! This lazy, sluggish angel apprentice Mika over here has been skipping those lessons, so much she's in the verge of getting retained from promotion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At this rate, she's going to be an angel apprentice for life...!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To break the status quo, Goddess Freya gave orders to Mika and her angel apprentice friends,\u00a0Bel and Az, to descend down to human land. Collect &quot;Love&quot; to avoid retention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a desert town full of mysteries, our Angel Apprentice Mika shall demonstrate her outstanding performance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...or, maybe not...!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2606Character Introduction</strong></h2></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340330/extras/2485e7fe1255eb29eb4afaeb0ca2a75a.avif?t=1753929241\" width=616 height=462 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605Michael (Mika)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A downer, lazy angel apprentice who is also the protagonist of this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She skipped too many &quot;Hospitality&quot; lessons - a lesson for angels to help humans - and ended up having to descend to human land for make-up lessons...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340330/extras/8d2e68c8d925b627297ad7f8826c333c.avif?t=1753929241\" width=616 height=462 /></span>\u2605Belzebuth (Bel)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A not-so-sharp, energetic angel apprentice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She just can't get along with Mika, and they fight literally every time they encounter each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She's too dull to get any credit on Hospitality, and is forced to take make-up lessons with Mika.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, bad thugs know a way or two around her ignorance...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340330/extras/1c5aa7dc53464cc61e9c365ce6c801d1.avif?t=1753929241\" width=616 height=462 /></span>\u2605Azrael (Az)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A somewhat cold, excellent role model-like angel, who is Mika and Bel's junior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is almost flawless, with the only flaw being her arrogance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goddess Freya gave her a mission to look after her underachieved seniors, and communicate with humans to soften her attitude while she's at it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But of course, Az is so full of pride, and that doesn't exactly make things easy...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340330/extras/b911bfa25215956e1db60b999fb4c7bc.avif?t=1753929241\" width=616 height=462 /></span>\u2605Freya</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A kind-hearted goddess who looks after Mika and others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She always wears a gentle smile like a goddess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She occasionally descends down to land to check up on Mika and the rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2606Game System</strong></h2></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340330/extras/d3bd76e1eb6329cac696a8fefca59a33.poster.avif?t=1753929241\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340330/extras/d3bd76e1eb6329cac696a8fefca59a33.webm?t=1753929241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340330/extras/d3bd76e1eb6329cac696a8fefca59a33.mp4?t=1753929241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humans don't just open up their minds that easily.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the power of the angels to initiate multiple-choice quiz mini-game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within a time limit, pick the right answer out among the four choices to earn their trusts and gain some &quot;Love&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quizzes range from general knowledge to in-game context!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you find it difficult, there are also assist items that can help you find the correct answer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Mika avoid retention by clearing quizzes and solve people's problems!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2606A Variety of Dress Up Costumes!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340330/extras/fac92769d122ad4e341db9fd47b0027c.poster.avif?t=1753929241\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340330/extras/fac92769d122ad4e341db9fd47b0027c.webm?t=1753929241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340330/extras/fac92769d122ad4e341db9fd47b0027c.mp4?t=1753929241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a large variety of costumes and accessories!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hair color, hairstyle, even skin color!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranging from simple cute and adorable to all kinds of fetishes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine your favorite accessories for your own original Mika!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Costumes also affects Mika's appearance in sidescrolling view indoors!</p>",
